{"number":101,"nameArabic":"القَارعَة","nameEnglish":"Al-Qaari'a","meaningEnglish":"The Calamity","revelationType":"Meccan","verseCount":11,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabic":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","english":"The Calamity!"},{"number":2,"arabic":"مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","english":"What is the Calamity?"},{"number":3,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","english":"Ah, what will convey unto thee what the Calamity is!"},{"number":4,"arabic":"يَوْمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلْفَرَاشِ ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ","english":"A day wherein mankind will be as thickly-scattered moths"},{"number":5,"arabic":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلْجِبَالُ كَٱلْعِهْنِ ٱلْمَنفُوشِ","english":"And the mountains will become as carded wool."},{"number":6,"arabic":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","english":"Then, as for him whose scales are heavy (with good works),"},{"number":7,"arabic":"فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَةٍ رَّاضِيَةٍ","english":"He will live a pleasant life."},{"number":8,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","english":"But as for him whose scales are light,"},{"number":9,"arabic":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةٌ","english":"A bereft and Hungry One will be his mother,"},{"number":10,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهْ","english":"Ah, what will convey unto thee what she is! -"},{"number":11,"arabic":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةٌۢ","english":"Raging Fire."}]}
